menu "I2C tools (cmd_i2c)"

    config CMD_I2C_DEFAULT_PORT
        int "I2C port the i2c commands use until i2cconfig says otherwise"
        range 0 2
        default 0
        help
            `i2cdetect`, `i2cget`, `i2cset` and `i2cdump` borrow the application's master
            bus on this port if it exists when they first run; `i2cconfig --port` changes
            it at run time. A board whose peripherals are not on port 0 (the ESP32-P4 dome
            panel keeps its droid devices on I2C1) sets this so the tools look there.

endmenu
